# Interannotator agreement study

Our team will annotate 1000 items. The first 41 items will be annotated by four humans and one AI. This distribution will allow there to be both pairwise and 5-way overlap.
When we have more than two annotators, we will use Fleiss’s κ (Kappa) as our metric. When we only have a human and AI overlapping, we will use Cohen’s κ (Kappa). 

